{"candidateAnswer":"From her travels in Europe","evidence":"[D8:15 | 6:03 pm on 6 March, 2023] Maria: Thanks, John! I got the idea from that trip to England a few years ago - I was mesmerized by the castles. I wanted to bring that same magic to my home, like a reminder of the world's beauty. I made a painting too!","itemId":"urn:uuid:ccea20cd-6eea-5ab1-b6ae-fbd706a294a8","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:ee42d2994df1f04067ef8a17cb5aa04647c41c57be30d757a8015577e299a97d","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Where did Maria get the idea for the castle shadow box in her home?","referenceAnswer":"England","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"ee42d2994df1f04067ef8a17cb5aa04647c41c57be30d757a8015577e299a97d"}}]}